(6894624, 1039405, 49109, '<td valign="top">Great concept, black and white works very well. Wonder why you cropped off his face -  a slightly lower angle would have worked wonders I assume. Since the light comes from almost the opposite direction as what the fake shadow suggests, a shoot at another time of the day might also have helped. Still my top pick so far.</td>', 'Great concept, black and white works very well. Wonder why you cropped off his face -  a slightly lower angle would have worked wonders I assume. Since the light comes from almost the opposite direction as what the fake shadow suggests, a shoot at another time of the day might also have helped. Still my top pick so far.', '2012-10-31 07:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6894626, 1039174, 147314, '<td valign="top">zn</td>', 'zn', '2012-10-31 07:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6894634, 1039552, 152656, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly clever!  I might have tried for softer light or a yellowish tone to give a little ambiance to the book as it looks a little institutionalized (no pun intended). I rated this VERY high anyway.  Although there are a other entires that are ''technically'' stronger, the imagination is what sold this image for me.  I don''t know if you''ll get a ribbon for it, but I believe you deserve it!!</td>', 'This is incredibly clever!  I might have tried for softer light or a yellowish tone to give a little ambiance to the book as it looks a little institutionalized (no pun intended). I rated this VERY high anyway.  Although there are a other entires that are ''technically'' stronger, the imagination is what sold this image for me.  I don''t know if you''ll get a ribbon for it, but I believe you deserve it!!', '2012-10-31 07:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
