(6894716, 1039304, 135629, '<td valign="top">I will be interested to know how this was done within the Advanced rules, but in giving the benefit of the doubt (always) I think it''s a really creative shadow entry! I gave this a 9. Would have been a 10 for me if there wasn''t so much negative space on the driveway to the bottom right, and if it was aligned horizontally with the base of the house. Great job!</td>', 'I will be interested to know how this was done within the Advanced rules, but in giving the benefit of the doubt (always) I think it''s a really creative shadow entry! I gave this a 9. Would have been a 10 for me if there wasn''t so much negative space on the driveway to the bottom right, and if it was aligned horizontally with the base of the house. Great job!', '2012-10-31 10:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
